      "Telegram direction is intentionally omitted so the same semantic telegram definition can be used for physical RX decoding and virtual-device TX encoding.",
      "Legacy metadata and channel names retained; roles replaced by user-approved three-part roles.",
      "Legacy ORG annotations moved into telegram_id.metadata so the normalized loader retains them.",
      "Top-level manufacturer/model/base_eep are mirrored in metadata because normalization ignores these compatibility annotations.",
